ed%20message%20and%20its%20independent%20property-presence%20value.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20name%20%40returns%20%7Bstring%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readJavaScriptExceptionConstructorOperation%28name%29%20%7B%0A%20%20return%20readJavaScriptSourceExceptionOperation%28name%29%3D%3D%3D%27%27%3F%27%27%3A%27constructAndRaiseJavaScript%27%2Bname%3B%0A%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20operation%20%40returns%20%7Bstring%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readJavaScriptExceptionConstructorClass%28operation%29%20%7B%0A%20%20if%28operation%3D%3D%3D%27constructAndRaiseJavaScriptError%27%29return%20%27Error%27%3B%0A%20%20if%28operation%3D%3D%3D%27constructAndRaiseJavaScriptTypeError%27%29return%20%27TypeError%27%3B%0A%20%20if%28operation%3D%3D%3D%27constructAndRaiseJavaScriptRangeError%27%29return%20%27RangeError%27%3B%0A%20%20if%28operation%3D%3D%3D%27constructAndRaiseJavaScriptSyntaxError%27%29return%20%27SyntaxError%27%3B%0A%20%20if%28operation%3D%3D%3D%27constructAndRaiseJavaScriptReferenceError%27%29return%20%27ReferenceError%27%3B%0A%20%20if%28operation%3D%3D%3D%27constructAndRaiseJavaScriptURIError%27%29return%20%27URIError%27%3B%0A%20%20return%20operation%3D%3D%3D%27constructAndRaiseJavaScriptEvalError%27%3F%27EvalError%27%3A%27%27%3B%0A%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20kind%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20operation%20%40returns%20%7Bboolean%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20acceptLinkedJavaScriptSourceException%28kind%2Coperation%29%20%7B%0A%20%20return%20kind%3D%3D%3D%27math%27%26%26readJavaScriptSourceExceptionClass%28operation%29%21%3D%3D%27%27%3B%0A%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Error%27s%20undefined%20message%20is%20absent%3B%20its%20null%20message%20is%20the%20text%20%22null%22.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20absence%20%40returns%20%7Bstring%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readJavaScriptSourceExceptionAbsentMessage%28absence%29%20%7B%0A%20%20return%20absence%3D%3D%3D%27null%27%3F%27null%27%3A%27%27%3B%0A%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7